==Polish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=pl|/ˈɲemt͡sɨ/}}
* {{audio|Pl-Niemcy.ogg|audio|lang=pl}}

===Etymology===
''[[Němьcь]]'' ‘a foreigner, ''lit.'' a mute, e.g. who doesn't speak Slavonic’<ref name="Vasmer">{{Cite book|last=Vasmer|first=Max|title=Etymological dictionary of the Russian language|volume=Volume III|publisher=Progress|year=1986|location=Moscow|language=Russian|page=62|url=http://etymolog.ruslang.ru/vasmer.php?id=62&vol=3 }}</ref> or unlikely from the name of the ancient {{w|Nemetes}} tribe.<ref name="Indo-European"/><ref name="PolishEtym"/>

